# madcide "vivid" scheme: the original colourful look (the pre-JOE-parity
# default) — every class gets a colour, including the AST-backed function
# class JOE doesn't have. Swap with ^K T.
keyword yellow
type green
string red
number magenta
comment cyan
function bold blue

# @gui workbench colours for the vivid scheme (a warmer accent).
@gui bg #201a24
@gui fg #ece4f0
@gui accent #f0a35e
